meta {
  name: Get Category
  type: http
  seq: 5
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/categories/:idOrSlug
  body: none
  auth: none
}

params:path {
  idOrSlug: design-creative
}

docs {
  ### Get Category
  Retrieves a single active category along with its active subcategories by either its UUID or unique slug. Public access, no authentication required.
  
  #### Route Parameters
  - `idOrSlug` (string, required) - Either the category UUID or the unique slug.
  
  #### Response (200 OK)
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "id": "uuid-1",
      "name": "Design & Creative",
      "slug": "design-creative",
      "active": true,
      "ordering": 1,
      "subCategories": [
        {
          "id": "uuid-2",
          "name": "Logo Design",
          "slug": "logo-design",
          "parent_id": "uuid-1",
          "active": true,
          "ordering": 1,
          "subCategories": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "message": "Category retrieved successfully"
  }
  ```
}
